  "era_overview": {
    "description": "1970 marked the absolute peak of muscle car power, followed by a rapid decline. Insurance rates, emissions regulations, unleaded fuel mandates, and the 1973 oil crisis combined to devastate performance. By decade's end, the 'malaise era' was in full swing.",
